  "briefings": {
    "A": "You and your teammate start together in the leftmost section. Read the clue 'manual' of each stage. You cannot see your teammate, and from a plate you usually cannot see its door. This map has several stages that must be cleared in order; observation 'stage' shows the current stage number, title and briefing. Clearing a stage removes its objects, puts both agents back at their start positions and loads the next stage. Your memory and conversation carry over. Object guide: switch_plate: while ANY agent stands within its radius, every door in its 'opens' list is unlocked; when nobody stands on any plate for a door, that door locks again. goal_zone: a rectangle centred on (x, y) with the given width/height.\nNothing in this map can make the task permanently impossible: mistakes only cost time (panels clear, pads push you back, doors close again). Other agents are invisible to you.",
    "B": "You and your teammate start together in the leftmost section. Read the clue 'manual' of each stage. You cannot see your teammate, and from a plate you usually cannot see its door. This map has several stages that must be cleared in order; observation 'stage' shows the current stage number, title and briefing. Clearing a stage removes its objects, puts both agents back at their start positions and loads the next stage. Your memory and conversation carry over. Object guide: switch_plate: while ANY agent stands within its radius, every door in its 'opens' list is unlocked; when nobody stands on any plate for a door, that door locks again. goal_zone: a rectangle centred on (x, y) with the given width/height.\nNothing in this map can make the task permanently impossible: mistakes only cost time (panels clear, pads push you back, doors close again). Other agents are invisible to you."
  }
